# Public website deploy allowlist (Vercel project: naveen-reddy-marriage-bureau)
#
# Everything is excluded by default. Only files that are intentionally public
# are re-included at the bottom. To publish a new public page or image, add an
# explicit "!/..." line in section 3 — never remove the "/*" or "/Assets/*" rules.
#
# Admin/ is a separate Vercel project and must never ship with this site.
# Rules are evaluated top to bottom; later rules win.

# 1. Deny everything at the root (files, folders, dotfiles)
/*

# 2. Open the Assets folder, but deny every file inside it by default
!/Assets/
/Assets/*

# Defence in depth: never ship these, even if allowed later by mistake
.*
*.md
*.map
*.log
*.bak
*.backup
*.old
*.orig
*.tmp
*.swp
*.zip
*.tar
*.gz
*.7z
*.rar
*.sql
*.db
*.sqlite
*.csv
*.xls
*.xlsx
*.xlsm
*.ods
*.doc
*.docx
*.pdf
*.json
*.env
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.crt
*.js
*.mjs
*.cjs
*.ts
*.tsx
*.sh
*.ps1
*.html
*seed*
*dummy*
*demo*
*secret*
*credential*
*backup*

# 3. Explicitly public files (must stay last so they win)
# Images used by the public pages
!/Assets/Logo-transparent.webp
!/Assets/Temple.png
!/Assets/Temple-hero.webp
!/Assets/Temple-hero-mobile.webp
!/Assets/Doodle.webp
# Pages
!/index.html
!/privacy-policy.html
!/terms.html
!/support.html
!/account-deletion.html
# Google site ownership verification - keep permanently
!/googlee1584360cfe843d2.html
!/google1a736d462f272294.html
!/robots.txt
!/sitemap.xml
!/our-branches.html
!/branches/
/branches/*
!/branches/somajiguda.html
!/branches/kothapet.html
!/branches/warangal.html
!/branches/karimnagar.html
# Read by Vercel for routing; Vercel does not serve vercel.json publicly
!/vercel.json

!/Assets/site-logo.jpg
!/Assets/site-doodle.jpg
!/Assets/Temple-opening-mobile.webp
!/Assets/Temple-opening-desktop.webp
